          "series_patch_count": 1,
          "version_history": [
            {
              "version": 1,
              "message_id": "20261002140727.701709-1-gourry@gourry.net",
              "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/all/20261002140727.701709-1-gourry@gourry.net/",
              "subject": "[PATCH] mm/damon: use damon_get_monitor_folio() for hugetlb entries",
              "date": "2026-10-02T14:07:41Z"
            }
          ],
          "series_items": [],
          "patch_summary": "This patch refactors the acquisition of hugetlb folios in DAMON to use a single helper function, damon_get_monitor_folio(), which is already used for monitored LRU and hugetlb folios. This change simplifies the code and ensures consistency across different paths.",
          "analysis_source": "llm",
          "review_comments": [
            {
              "author": "SJ Park",
              "summary": "Approved the patch and mentioned that it will be picked up by Andrew Morton if not added to mm.git within a week.",
              "sentiment": "POSITIVE",
              "sentiment_signals": [
                "approval"
              ],
              "has_inline_review": false,
              "tags_given": [
                "Reviewed-by"
              ],
              "raw_body": "Hello Gregory,\n\nOn Fri,  2 Oct 2026 10:07:27 -0400 \"Gregory Price (Meta)\" <gourry@gourry.net> wrote:\n\n> From: Gregory Price <gourry@gourry.net>\n> \n> Hugetlb folio acquisition is open-coded in three places:\n>   - damon_hugetlb_mkold()\n>   - damon_young_hugetlb_entry()\n>   - damon_va_probe_hugetlb_entry()\n> \n> DAMON already has damon_get_monitor_folio(), which paddr uses to\n> get monitored LRU and hugetlb folios and to filter them through\n> damon_folio_acceptable().  These paths bypass that check.\n> \n> Use that helper in these paths too, so that DAMON acquires hugetlb\n> folios and applies its acceptance policy in one place.\n> \n> No functional change intended. All callers reach these paths with a\n> present hugetlb PTE under the page table lock, so the folio is always\n> a mapped hugetlb folio and the helper always returns it.\n\nThank you for this patch, looks good to me!\n\n> \n> Signed-off-by: Gregory Price (Meta) <gourry@gourry.net>\n\nReviewed-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>\n\n\nThis patch is applied to damon/next [1] tree.  If this patch is not added to\nmm.git in short term (~1 week?), I will ask mm.git maintainer (Andrew Morton)\nto pick this.  So, no action from your side is needed for now.  If it seems I\nalso forgot doing that or you cannot wait for my action, please feel free to\nping me or Andrew.\n\n[1] https://origin.kernel.org/doc/html/latest/mm/damon/maintainer-profile.html#scm-trees\n\n\nThanks,\nSJ\n\n[...]\n",
              "reply_to": "",
              "message_date": "2026-10-02",
              "message_id": "",
              "analysis_source": "llm",
              "email": "sj@kernel.org"
            }
          ],
